        "Description": "Bring the red REMOTE EXPLOSIVE DUCK.\rHead to the helipad and place the duck next to the windsock (on banister or on the ground).\rGet Chief Surgeon disguise.\rGo into the Robot Surgery Control room near where Erich Soders&apos; surgery is taking place.\rInteract with the terminal labeled &quot;PLAY HITMINE&quot; now and play the mini-game.\rUse WASD keys.\rIf you fail, Kai vocalizes pain, but the easter egg is not voided.\rRestart until you win.\rWinning triggers explosive ducks to rain on Soders, hallelujah.",
